<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">The personal data we need</h2>
<div>
    <p>The personal data we collect includes:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet" style="padding-left:50px">
        <li>names</li>
        <li>addresses</li>
        <li>contact details (including phone numbers, fax and email addresses)</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Your responsibility</h2>
<div>
    <p>
        If you have included personal data about any other individuals in your submissions to WEEE Online, you must inform them.
        You must provide them with a copy of this privacy policy so that they are aware of how their personal data will be used.
    </p>
</div>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">What we do with your personal data</h2>
<p>We use the personal data to regulate you in accordance with the WEEE regulations.</p>
<p>We do not use your data to make an automated decision or for automated profiling.</p>
<p>
    We will share your personal data with:
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet" style="padding-left:50px">
        <li>our IT suppliers who host and provide the WEEE Online service</li>
        <li>finance providers who process your personal information to send invoices on our behalf</li>
    </ul>
</p>
<p>
    We may also share your personal data with our law enforcement and regulatory partners in order to undertake background checks,
    for the detection and prevention of crime and to support enforcement actions.
</p>
<p>
    We put the following personal data on a public register:
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet" style="padding-left:50px">
        <li>names (WEEE approved compliance schemes and EEE producer public registers)</li>
        <li>addresses (EEE producer public register)</li>
        <li>contact details (WEEE approved compliance schemes and EEE producer public registers)</li>
    </ul>
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">How long we keep your personal data</h2>
<p>
    We currently retain your data indefinitely; we are currently working on functionality within the service to adhere to our
    internal retention policy. This Notice will be updated in due course.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Where your personal data is processed and stored</h2>
<div>
    <p>
        We store and process your personal data on servers in the UK. We will not transfer your personal data outside the European Economic Area.
    </p>
    <p>
        WEEE Online utilises WorldPay which transfers your data through Amazon Web Services servers in Ireland.
    </p>
    <p>
        We store data on Microsoft Azure servers in Ireland.
    </p>
    <p>
        By submitting your personal data, you agree to this transfer, storing or processing. We will take all steps reasonably necessary to ensure that your data is treated securely.
    </p>
</div>

